PKWARE Data Compression Library ("implode") decompressor
--------------------------------------------------------
`js/importer/blast.js` is a JavaScript port of Mark Adler's `blast.c`
(zlib/contrib/blast), via the Apache-2.0 C# translation by James Telfer used in
the OpenCiv3 project.

